### Interpolation Implementation Report

#### 1. Every Guard Added and What It Protects
- **[Medium.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Medium.js#L203)**:
  - `jumping` countdown in [`d()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Medium.js#L203): guarded with `!this.interpolating` so camera jump timer advances only on game ticks.
- **[ContO.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/ContO.js#L180-L192)**:
  - `p[j].exp` state updates in [`d()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/ContO.js#L180): guarded so explosion state transitions across polygon faces only occur on simulation ticks.
  - `hit` flag setting in [`d()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/ContO.js#L225): guarded so jumping collision trigger does not re-trip during sub-frames.
  - `hit` reset and `exp` triggering in [`d()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/ContO.js#L270): guarded so object destruction and hit state clearance occur only on ticks.
- **[Plane.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Plane.js#L148-L245)**:
  - In [`d()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Plane.js#L148): guarded explosion velocity initialization (`exp === 2 -> 3`), fragment position integration (`ofx`, `ofy`, `ofz`, `ezy`, `exy`, `ady`), smoke particle vertex movement (`sx`, `sy`, `sz`, `sdy`), particle stage advances (`exp` increments), and smoke fading (`sr`, `sg` decrements).
  - In [`s()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Plane.js#L484): guarded shadow explosion random initialization (`exp === 1 -> 2`) and fragment position integration.
- **[Craft.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Craft.js#L677-L745)** / **[Tank.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Tank.js#L436-L468)** / **[userCraft.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/userCraft.js#L569-L635)**:
  - In [`dosmokes()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Craft.js#L677): guarded damage smoke (`dms`) and ground smoke (`sms`) particle spawning, slot index increments (`nd`, `ns`), vertical velocity integration (`dy -= 15`, `sy -= 15` / `sy -= 10`), and stage counters.
  - In [`dl()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Craft.js#L845): guarded laser impact stage increment (`++lhit[n]`) and expiration (`lstage[i] = 0`).
- **[xtGraphics.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/xtGraphics.js#L131-L1275)**:
  - In [`denter()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/xtGraphics.js#L131):
    - `fase === -8`: guarded text scroll counter `cnty`.
    - `fase === -5`: guarded cursor animation counter `cnt`, logo slide `cnts`, spark offset `cntf`, "no saved game" flash timer `wcnt`, and blink state `flik`.
    - `fase === -4`: guarded station damage indicator blink `flik`.
    - `fase === 0`: guarded wireframe toggle counter `wcnt`, ship selection slide counter `rcnt`, and 3D ship presentation rotation `aconto[l3].xz += 2`.
    - `fase === -1`: guarded enemy ship presentation rotation `aconto[this.ob[i3]].xz += 7 + i3` and prompt blink `flik`.
    - `fase === 3`: guarded pause menu box blink `flik`.
    - `fase === 5, 6, 7`: guarded credits 3D ship rotations (`zy += 5`, `--xy`), completion flash `flik`, and completion countdown `cnt`.
    - All menu keyboard input processing (`control.space`, `control.up`, `control.down`, `control.left`, `control.right`, `control.canclick`) guarded so key consumption only happens on ticks.
  - In [`dtrakers()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/xtGraphics.js#L1075-L1275):
    - Target destroyed/crashed message timer `cnte` and color alternate counter `cntf`.
    - Mission complete banner rainbow cycle counter `rcnt`.
    - Ship critical warning blink `flik` and flash counter `cnt`.
    - Jump expired alert duration `control.jump`.
    - Speedometer fade counter `cnts`.
    - Inactivity hint timer `tcnt`.
- **[F51.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/F51.js#L1339-L1650)**:
  - Race simulation loop: guarded enemy collision tests ([`tryexp`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/ContO.js#L278)), laser collision handling ([`lasercolid`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Craft.js#L800)), physics integration ([`preform`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Craft.js#L300)), sound triggers (`this.exp.start()`, `this.hitl.start()`), camera follow state machines ([`behinde`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Medium.js#L280), [`right`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Medium.js#L330), [`infront`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Medium.js#L230), [`left`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Medium.js#L305), [`around`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Medium.js#L355), [`watch`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Medium.js#L255)), and phase end conditions.
  - Menu loops: guarded camera orbital tracking ([`medium.around`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Medium.js#L355)) and phase transition triggers (`savegame`, `loadmovers`, `loadsaved`, `setmover`, `set0`).

