#### 2. Draw-Time Random Numbers
- All draw-time random calls route through [`random()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/java.js#L75) in [port/java.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/java.js):
  - [Plane.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Plane.js#L149): explosion particle trajectory vectors (`sdx`, `sdz`, `sdy`), particle jitter offsets in smoke vertices (`ai4`, `ai5`, `ai6`), and shadow fragment random seeds (`adx`, `adz`, `ady`, `ofcx`, `ofcy`, `ofcz`, `nx`, `ny`, `nz`, `azy`, `axy`).
  - [Lasers.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Lasers.js#L130): laser spark rendering jitter.
  - [Craft.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Craft.js#L681) / [Tank.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/Tank.js#L440) / [userCraft.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/userCraft.js#L573): damage and ground smoke spawn offsets.
  - [xtGraphics.js](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/xtGraphics.js#L186): menu background spark lines, random rad offsets, mission complete rainbow fill colors, and credits rotating ship models.
- **Recording & Replay**:
  - Ticks record generated PRNG values via [`startRandomRecording()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/java.js#L79).
  - Interpolated sub-frames replay the recorded sequence identically using [`startRandomReplay()`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/java.js#L85), preventing spark/flame shimmer.

