#### 3. What is Snapshotted and Restored
- **`ContO` Objects**:
  - `aconto2[0..maxco]` and `aconto[0..53]`:
    - Linear fields: `x`, `y`, `z` (interpolated with `Math.round(blend(..., false))`).
    - Angular fields: `xz`, `xy`, `zy` (interpolated shortest-path modular arithmetic via `blend(..., true)` and evaluated with fractional table lerp in [`SinCos.getsin`/`getcos`](file:///home/evan/resources/ra1/port/SinCos.js#L38)).
    - Depth sorting distance: `dist` (written during sub-frame painter sorting and restored to the exact tick value by `restoreCurr()`).
- **`Medium` Camera**:
  - `x`, `y`, `z` (linear rounded blend), `xz`, `zy` (shortest-path angle blend).

